# Copyright & licensing note — VR module

The files listed below are **original works of Patrick Carey**
(<patrickfcarey@gmail.com>), authored from scratch for this VR fork. They do not
exist in upstream PCSX2; they were added in this fork's history.

They are offered **in this repository** under the repository's license —
`SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0`, as marked in each file's header.

The copyright holder reserves all rights in these original works, **including the
right to license the same code under other terms in sibling projects**.

Scope: this note concerns **copyright attribution only**. It does not alter the
license under which these files are distributed in this repository, and it does not
apply to upstream-authored PCSX2 files — whose headers are left exactly as upstream
has them, including around any edits made to wire this module in.

## Covered files

