That is every source file in this directory. The development tooling written for
this module is likewise original work of the same author and carries its own note.

## Third-party data in this directory

These files carry data from other people's works, under those works' own licenses.
Each states its license and its source in its own header, as `ItemData.cpp` does for
the MIT-licensed Outbreak-Research item table.

- `HandMeshData.inc` (with `HandMesh.cpp` / `.h` that read it): the low-poly hand
  model of Godot XR Tools (GodotVR/godot-xr-tools, `addons/godot-xr-tools/hands/`),
  **CC0 1.0 Universal**. "DigitalN8m4r3 aka Miodrag Sejic has waived all copyright
  and related or neighboring rights to Hand Models for the Godot XR Tools" (7th
  November 2022); its base mesh is from MakeHuman's CC0 assets. The file is the
  mesh posed and baked by `tools/outbreak-vr/convert_hand_gltf.py`; the model's
  glTF files are not in this repository.

_Last updated 2026-10-12._
